hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"font-family: Roboto; font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">2 BHK</span></p></td><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"1\" data-cell-height=\"0.464in\" style=\"border-width: 0.666667px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 9.12px 7.97px; vertical-align: bottom; height: 0.464in; width: 326.304px;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" ff\":\"roboto\",\"fv\":\"normal\",\"td\":\"none\",\"cs\":\"0pt\",\"fw\":\"none\",\"fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"12.00\",\"va\":\"baseline\",\"fw_i\":400,\"type\":\"text\",\"fs\":\"normal\",\"bgc\":\"rgba(0,=\"\" 0)\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"font-family: Roboto; font-size: 12pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">₹35,000 to ₹45,000</span></p></td></tr><tr data-row-info=\"{\" id\":\"7s8qb51yp0x9\",\"type\":\"row\"}\"=\"\"><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"0\" data-cell-height=\"0.464in\" style=\"border-width: 0.666667px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 9.12px 7.97px; vertical-align: bottom; height: 0.464in; width: 323.616px;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" ff\":\"roboto\",\"fv\":\"normal\",\"td\":\"none\",\"cs\":\"0pt\",\"fw\":\"none\",\"fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"12.00\",\"va\":\"baseline\",\"fw_i\":400,\"type\":\"text\",\"fs\":\"normal\",\"bgc\":\"rgba(0,=\"\" 0)\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"font-family: Roboto; font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">3 BHK</span></p></td><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"1\" data-cell-height=\"0.464in\" style=\"border-width: 0.666667px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 9.12px 7.97px; vertical-align: bottom; height: 0.464in; width: 326.304px;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" ff\":\"roboto\",\"fv\":\"normal\",\"td\":\"none\",\"cs\":\"0pt\",\"fw\":\"none\",\"fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"12.00\",\"va\":\"baseline\",\"fw_i\":400,\"type\":\"text\",\"fs\":\"normal\",\"bgc\":\"rgba(0,=\"\" 0)\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"font-family: Roboto; font-size: 12pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">₹75,000 to ₹90,000</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"font-size: 14px;\"></p><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Source: <a href=\"https://www.magicbricks.com/furnished-flats-for-rent-in-marathahalli-bangalore-pppfr\" target=\"_blank\">Magicbricks</a></span></p><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">*These prices fluctuate based on factors like location, amenities, and the condition of the apartment.</span></p></h2>",
      "type": "text-block"
    },
    {
      "content": "<h2>Key Features to Evaluate</h2><h3>1. Location</h3><p>Where your new home is matters a lot. Is it near your workplace, school, hospitals, and if there are places to shop nearby.&nbsp;</p><h4>Proximity to Key Locations:&nbsp;</h4><p>IT Parks:<b> Bagmane Constellation Business Park, Ecospace Bellandur&nbsp;</b>and other major companies are nearby.&nbsp;</p><p>Healthcare: <b>Sakra World Hospital </b>and <b>Jeevika Hospital </b>are within reach.</p><p>Shopping malls and groceries are easily accessible.</p><p><i>Also Read: <a href=\"https://www.kots.world/blog/proximity-to-hubs-benefits-of-urban-gated-apartments-in-whitefield\" target=\"_blank\">Proximity to Hubs: Benefits of Urban Gated Apartments in Whitefield</a></i></p>",
      "type": "text-block"
    },
    {
      "content": "<h3>2. Amenities</h3>",
      "type": "text-block"
    },
    {
      "content": "<p>Furnished apartments often come with various amenities. Evaluate what is included in the rental price. Common amenities to look for include:&nbsp;</p><h3>Common:&nbsp;</h3><p>24-hour security&nbsp;</p><p>Reliable power and water backup&nbsp;</p><p>Complimentary Internet&nbsp;</p><p>Rooftop garden&nbsp;</p><p>Gym&nbsp;</p><p>Laundry Area&nbsp;</p><p>Parking&nbsp;</p><h3>Inside the apartment:&nbsp;</h3><p>Smart TV&nbsp;</p><p>Refrigerator&nbsp;</p><p>Modular Kitchen&nbsp;</p><p>Microwave&nbsp;</p><p>Mattress&nbsp;</p><p>Wardrobe&nbsp;</p><p>Study Table and Chair&nbsp;</p><p>Geyser&nbsp;</p><p>Cloth Dryer Stand&nbsp;</p><p>Shoe Rack</p>",
      "type": "text-block"
    },
    {
      "content": "<h3>3. Apartment Condition</h3><p>Inspect the apartment's condition before making a decision. Look for:</p><p><b>1.</b> Look at the furniture. Is it new or old and broken?&nbsp;</p><p><b>2. </b>Do the things like the fridge and stove work?&nbsp;</p><p><b>3. </b>And is the whole place clean? A clean apartment is usually a good thing.</p>",
      "type": "text-block"
    },
    {
      "content": "<h3>4. Cost Analysis</h3><p><b>Price per Square Foot</b></p><p>Understanding the price per square foot can help you evaluate if the rent is reasonable. To calculate:</p><p><b>1.</b> Find the total rent.</p><p><b>2. </b>Divide by the total area in square feet.</p><p>This will give you a clear picture of whether the apartment is priced fairly compared to others in the area.</p><p><b>Example Calculation:</b></p><p>Total Rent: ₹40,000</p><p>Area: 1,200 sq. ft.</p><p>Price per Sq. Ft.: ₹40,000 / 1,200 = ₹33.33</p>",
      "type": "text-block"
    },
    {
      "content": "<h3>5. Additional Costs</h3><p>When you think about how much an apartment costs, don't forget about additional costs you might need to pay. You might have to pay for things like&nbsp;</p><p><b>1.</b> Maintenance&nbsp;</p><p><b>2.</b> Electricity, water, and internet bills&nbsp;</p><p><b>3. </b>Brokerage fee.</p>",
      "type": "text-block"
    },
    {
      "content": "<h3>6. Legal Considerations</h3><p>Before you agree to rent a place, make sure you understand the rules. Key documents to review include:</p><p><b>1.</b> Rental Agreement</p><p><b>2.</b> Terms and Conditions</p><p><b>3.</b> Deposit Terms</p><p><i>Also Read: <a href=\"https://www.kots.world/blog/rental-agreement-its-types-and-its-benefits\" target=\"_blank\">Rental Agreement: Its Types and Its Benefits</a></i><br></p>",
      "type": "text-block"
    },
    {
      "content": "<p>You should be in charge of finding your perfect apartment. Listen to your gut feeling, ask lots of questions, and don't be afraid to say no to places you don't like. The perfect apartment is waiting for you!</p><p>If you’re ready to find your ideal home, explore urban gated apartments for rent in <b>Whitefield, Bellandur, Mahadevapura, Marathahalli, Sarjapura, Hennur, and Horamavu</b> near your work spot. Visit <a href=\"https://www.kots.world/\" target=\"_blank\">KOTS.WORLD</a> today to discover the best options tailored to your needs!&nbsp;</p>",
      "type": "text-block"
    }
  ],
